{
  "name": "ReviewPilot - SonarQube MCP Diagnostic (Phase 7)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ReviewPilot - SonarQube MCP Diagnostic (Fase 7)\n- **Objetivo:** validar a conectividade `HTTP Streamable` (`http://sonarqube-mcp:8080/mcp`) na rede interna `reviewpilot-net` (quando o profile `quality` estiver ativo) ou confirmar a degradação graciosa (`UNAVAILABLE_OPTIONAL`) quando o SonarQube estiver desligado.\n- **Credencial exigida:** `ReviewPilot SonarQube MCP Read-Only` (`Bearer Auth` com token de usuário SonarQube).\n- **Como testar:** defina `projectKey` no nó `Configure SonarQube Project Target` (ex.: `auto-elite`) e clique em **Test workflow**.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 680
      },
      "id": "e7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "SonarQube MCP Diagnostic Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "e7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "When clicking 'Test workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-project-key",
              "name": "projectKey",
              "value": "auto-elite",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Configure SonarQube Project Target",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable",
        "endpointUrl": "http://sonarqube-mcp:8080/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "get_project_quality_gate_status"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={\n  \"projectKey\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.projectKey) }}\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "e7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Query Quality Gate via SonarQube MCP",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        760,
        340
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "httpBearerAuth": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID_SONARQUBE_MCP_BEARER",
          "name": "ReviewPilot SonarQube MCP Read-Only"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ok-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "SONARQUBE_MCP_READONLY_SUCCEEDED",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ok-transport",
              "name": "transport",
              "value": "httpStreamable",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ok-tool",
              "name": "toolExecuted",
              "value": "get_project_quality_gate_status",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ok-result",
              "name": "mcpResult",
              "value": "={{ $json }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Format SonarQube MCP Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1080,
